{"1841360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Queen's Loyalty", "steam_appid": 1841360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Story]</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/4da850103019a825b588dc9fdf221766.poster.avif?t=1765328572\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/4da850103019a825b588dc9fdf221766.webm?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/4da850103019a825b588dc9fdf221766.mp4?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andalun and Confunia, ruled by the Goddess of Order and Goddess of Chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the Goddess of Chaos disappears and monster queens appear in Confunia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To keep the monster queens in check, Traborn, the leader of the Knights of Order, went on an expedition to Confunia under orders from the Goddess of Order. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the expedition, Traborn personally obtained an oath of loyalty from all the monster queens of Confunia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He made himself Overlord of Confunia and signed a peace treaty with the Andalun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Traborn fell into a deep sleep to control the power he received from the Monster Queens... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he woke up after a long time, the promised peace did not exist.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[How to play]</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/fb252dfb10adb6282ad240d2745ebafe.poster.avif?t=1765328572\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/fb252dfb10adb6282ad240d2745ebafe.webm?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/fb252dfb10adb6282ad240d2745ebafe.mp4?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unite the scattered Monster Queens and reclaim your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to enhance each Queen’s stats and skills,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and hold your enemies accountable for breaking the peace accord.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attractive characters (13 playable characters)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/f99d921bd93afa046083c71bc1865811.poster.avif?t=1765328572\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/f99d921bd93afa046083c71bc1865811.webm?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/f99d921bd93afa046083c71bc1865811.mp4?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interesting story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/cdbbd9fb1b2f65882d7b7a03475a83c6.poster.avif?t=1765328572\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/cdbbd9fb1b2f65882d7b7a03475a83c6.webm?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/cdbbd9fb1b2f65882d7b7a03475a83c6.mp4?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle through various character combinations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/1169492cffdef11269d6e7bd9476c44a.poster.avif?t=1765328572\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/1169492cffdef11269d6e7bd9476c44a.webm?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/1169492cffdef11269d6e7bd9476c44a.mp4?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop your own unique character by distributing stats and skills</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/bd2a0c05b7b8bc55f6759c1d82a2c150.poster.avif?t=1765328572\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/bd2a0c05b7b8bc55f6759c1d82a2c150.webm?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841360/extras/bd2a0c05b7b8bc55f6759c1d82a2c150.mp4?t=1765328572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_parag